1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,490
(Leonard:)You'll never guess
what just happened.

2
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:05,170
(Sheldon:)You went out in the hallway,

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:07,110
(Sheldon:)stumbled into
an interdimensional portal

4
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:09,240
(Sheldon:)which brought you 5,000 years
into the future,

5
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,280
(Sheldon:)where you took advantage
of the advanced technology

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,580
(Sheldon:)to build a time machine,
and now you're back

7
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,830
(Sheldon:)to bring us all with you
to the year 7010

8
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:18,120
(Sheldon:)where we are transported
to work at the Thinkatorium

9
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:21,520
(Sheldon:)by telepathically controlled
flying dolphins?

10
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,720
(Raj:)No.

11
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,460
(Sheldon:)Aw.

12
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:29,290
(Leonard:)Penny kissed me.

13
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,360
(Sheldon:)Well, who would ever guess that?

14
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,670
What-what kind of a kiss?

15
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:35,500
(Leonard:)A big kiss. On the mouth.

16
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,870
(Howard:)Is it possible that she was
going for your cheek

17
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:40,570
(Howard:)and you moved
and she accidentally got lip?

18
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:44,010
(Howard:)That happens with me and my mom
all the time.

19
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,640
(Leonard:)She introduced me to her father,

20
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:49,150
(Leonard:)kissed me and then
shut the door in my face.

21
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:51,520
(Howard:)Maybe she was trying
to send you a message.

22
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,580
(Leonard:)You think?

23
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:54,040
(Leonard:)Yeah.
"This man is not my father.

24
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,520
"I'm being held hostage.

25
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,720
"So I'm going to do

26
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,160
"something insane in the hopes

27
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,260
that you'll call 911."

